---
kind: lore
id: north.victoryRoadTrainers
title: Victory Road
---

// Victory Road's trainers and the crater near its summit
// (place.victoryRoadCrater), where the fire bird blazewing nests. Kai's
// meeting is the scene north.victoryRoad; repeat visits get the entry below.

<entry id="northVictoryRoadAgain" on="enterPlace" target="place.victoryRoad" category="bark" priority="-1">
  @narrator: The ladders creak. Somewhere above, a trainer is shouting at a boulder.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="victoryRoadCooltrainerNaomi" who="victoryRoadCooltrainerNaomi" intro="Eight badges gets you in. It doesn't get you out. Show me what got you here!" win="That got you here. Fair enough." lose="Not enough to get you out!" prize="3400"/>

<entry id="northNaomiAfter" on="talk" target="npc.victoryRoadCooltrainerNaomi" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['victoryRoadCooltrainerNaomi'])">
  @victoryRoadCooltrainerNaomi: Tarrok of the Elite Four trained here as a boy. He says he moved half these boulders himself. I believe him.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="victoryRoadCooltrainerElias" who="victoryRoadCooltrainerElias" intro="I've been in this cave for three weeks. I'm not lost. I'm training. Mostly training." win="Okay, a little lost." lose="See? Training works!" prize="3400"/>

<entry id="northEliasAfter" on="talk" target="npc.victoryRoadCooltrainerElias" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['victoryRoadCooltrainerElias'])">
  @victoryRoadCooltrainerElias: The exit's past the crater. You'll know the crater when your boots start smoking.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="victoryRoadBlackBeltGrum" who="victoryRoadBlackBeltGrum" intro="Hoo-ah! I split boulders with my bare hands! You're softer than a boulder!" win="Harder than a boulder. Noted." lose="Split!" prize="3000"/>

<entry id="northGrumAfter" on="talk" target="npc.victoryRoadBlackBeltGrum" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['victoryRoadBlackBeltGrum'])">
  @victoryRoadBlackBeltGrum: My hands hurt. Don't tell Master Hollis.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="victoryRoadTamerOsric" who="victoryRoadTamerOsric" intro="My monsters are wild at heart. I only keep them calm. Most of the time. Let's see what happens today!" win="Calm. Very calm. Too calm." lose="Wild at heart!" prize="3200"/>

<entry id="northOsricAfter" on="talk" target="npc.victoryRoadTamerOsric" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['victoryRoadTamerOsric'])">
  @victoryRoadTamerOsric: The crater near the top? Don't go there without something that can swim in lava. Or at least something that can't burn.
</entry>

// ── the crater: blazewing ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="blazewing" on="enterPlace" target="place.victoryRoadCrater" title="The fire bird" once="false" when="!holds('caught', ['blazewing'])">
  ::bg{location="victory-road-crater" time="night"}
  ::music{action="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
  @narrator: The tunnel opens into a crater lit from below by a lake of slow orange rock. On a spur of black stone in the middle, a bird of flame lifts its head.
  @narrator: The road-builders went around it. {{userName}} does not.
  ::encounter{species="blazewing" level="50"}
</beat>

<entry id="northCraterEmpty" on="enterPlace" target="place.victoryRoadCrater" category="bark" when="holds('caught', ['blazewing'])">
  @narrator: The spur in the middle of the crater is empty. The lava below it has a crust on it, for the first time in a hundred years.
</entry>
